        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "The relevant work order is **WO-2025-09-004 (MO-25-09-1070)** at Modine’s Racine site. Its component-issue event, source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** (cost event **CE-250904-0004**), is for **$284,763.42** (28,476,342 cents).\n\n- **Event created:** `2025-09-30T19:15:00`\n- **September period entered Pending Close:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **Time after Pending Close:** **75 minutes**\n- **Recorded accounting status:** **POSTED**\n- **Consistent with Oracle’s documented treatment?** **No.** The event was created after Pending Close; the supplied Oracle 26B policy says newly created transactions are not processed while the period is Pending Close, even if they relate to that period. The recorded POSTED status is therefore inconsistent.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified.",
